  Wallet
  Unavailable: wallet daemon refused the request (daemon_upgrade_required): A wallet daemon from a
  different Corbanu Terminal release is still running. No new wallet operation was sent. Let any
  existing payment finish and verify its outcome; then close Terminal sessions for this home and
  stop only the pfterminal-walletd (or corbanu-walletd) process whose --codex-home is [home] using
  your operating system's process manager. Reopen Terminal to start the matching daemon.
  Restarting only the TUI does not stop the daemon. Do not delete the wallet directory, socket or
  ownership lock, and do not repeat a payment whose outcome is unknown.

› 1. Retry

  Press enter to confirm or esc to go back
